<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>내 물품 관리 - 중고마켓 동네생활</title>

    <link href="/krds/css/token/krds_tokens.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="/krds/css/common/common.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="/krds/css/component/component.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script defer src="/krds/js/component/ui-script.js"></script>

    <style>
        body { background-color: #ffffff; } 
        #krds-footer { background-color: #f4f6f9; margin-top: 80px; padding: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        
        .btn-logout-fix::before, .btn-logout-fix::after { display: none !important; }
        .btn-logout-fix { display: inline-flex !important; flex-direction: row !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 4px !important; width: auto !important; white-space: nowrap !important; }
        .btn-logout-fix svg { display: block !important; margin: 0 !important; }
        
        .header-branding { display: flex; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
        .header-branding .logo, .header-branding .logo a { background: none !important; background-image: none !important; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; }

        .subpage-container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 0 20px; min-height: 50vh; }
        .page-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 2px solid #222; padding-bottom: 16px; }
        .page-title { font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #111; margin: 0; }
        
        .btn-write { background-color: #246beb; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s; }
        .btn-write:hover { background-color: #1d56bc; }

        .manage-list { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-top: 2px solid #495057; }
        .manage-list th, .manage-list td { padding: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef; text-align: center; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .manage-list th { background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #333; font-weight: bold; }
        .manage-list td.title-col { text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111; }
        
        .action-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; }
        .btn-edit { background-color: #f1f3f5; color: #495057; border: 1px solid #ced4da; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 1.3rem; text-decoration: none; }
        .btn-edit:hover { background-color: #e9ecef; }
        .btn-delete { background-color: #fff0f6; color: #e03131; border: 1px solid #ffc9c9; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 1.3rem; cursor: pointer; }
        .btn-delete:hover { background-color: #ffe3e3; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap" class="g-wrap">

    <header id="krds-header">
        <div class="header-in">
            <div class="header-container">
                <div class="inner">
                    <div class="header-branding">
                        <h1 class="logo">
                            <a href="/" style="display: block;">
                                <img src="/sitelogo.png" alt="사이트 로고" style="height: 45px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;">
                            </a>
                        </h1>

                        <div class="header-actions" style="margin-left: auto;">
                            <span class="btn-navi my" style="background:none; cursor:default;">
                                <strong><%= user.username %></strong>님
                            </span>
                            <a href="/logout" class="btn-navi btn-logout-fix" style="text-decoration: none; color: #333;">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-top:-2px;">
                                    <path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"></path>
                                    <polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"></polyline>
                                    <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"></line>
                                </svg>
                                <span>로그아웃</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <nav class="krds-main-menu">
                <div class="inner">
                    <ul class="gnb-menu" aria-label="메인 메뉴">
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/info'">서비스 안내</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/board'">게시판</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/friends'">친구 관리</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="gnb-main-trigger" onclick="location.href='/items'">판매 물품 정보</button></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div id="container" class="subpage-container">
        <div class="page-header">
            <h2 class="page-title">내 판매 물품 관리</h2>
            <a href="/items/write" class="btn-write">새 판매글 등록하기 ✏️</a>
        </div>
        
        <table class="manage-list">
            <colgroup>
                <col style="width: 10%;">
                <col style="width: auto;">
                <col style="width: 15%;">
                <col style="width: 15%;">
                <col style="width: 20%;">
            </colgroup>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>번호</th>
                    <th>물품명</th>
                    <th>가격</th>
                    <th>등록일</th>
                    <th>관리</th>
                </tr>
            </thead><tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>1</td>
                    <td class="title-col">안쓰는 의자 팝니다</td>
                    <td>10,000원</td>
                    <td>2026.06.04</td>
                    <td>
                        <div class="action-btns">
                            <a href="/items/edit" class="btn-edit">수정</a>
                            
                            <form action="/items/delete" method="POST" style="display:inline; margin:0;">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn-delete" onclick="return confirm('정말 삭제하시겠습니까? 삭제 후에는 복구할 수 없습니다.');">삭제</button>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

    </div>

    <footer id="krds-footer">
        <div class="inner">
            <div class="f-btm">
                <div class="f-btm-text">
                    <div class="f-menu">
                        <a href="/terms" class="krds-btn small text">이용 안내</a>
                        <a href="/privacy" class="krds-btn small text">개인정보처리방침</a>
                        <a href="/copyright" class="krds-btn small text">저작권 정책</a>
                    </div>
                    <p class="f-copy">© 2026 Korea National University of Transportation. All rights reserved.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>